reauth_confirm.description:
The valve refused the stored pairing. Through an ESPHome Bluetooth proxy this usually means the proxy has lost the pairing, not that anything is wrong with the valve (see Known issues in the documentation).

Put the valve in pairing mode (see your manual), then select **Submit** within about 30 seconds. The existing pairing is tried once more first, so nothing is lost if it still works.

In range and able to connect: {connectable}

reconfigure.description:
Use this after moving or replacing the Bluetooth adapter or proxy nearest the valve (the pairing is stored on the adapter that made it), or after changing presets in the Mira app.

The existing pairing is tried first. If the valve refuses it, the valve must be in pairing mode (see your manual): select **Submit** within about 30 seconds of putting it there.

In range and able to connect: {connectable}
